              <a class="toc__link" href="#c1704">
                
                    2. Clean energy security in the mid-transition
                  
                <svg class="icon toc__link-icon toc__link-icon--after" aria-label="hidden" focusable="false">
                  <use xlink:href="#link-2"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
